        <type>const int</type>
        <definition>const int ndxlSetVertexCallback</definition>
        <argsstring>(NDXLVertex *_Vertex, NDXLVertexCallback _Callback)</argsstring>
        <name>ndxlSetVertexCallback</name>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1ad03a49b11a22416ba63273c4d7deb38b" kindref="member">NDXLVertex</ref> *</type>
          <declname>_Vertex</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="group__vertex__dnc_1ga8157fab181cba9d4fc99244e4179cbfb" kindref="member">NDXLVertexCallback</ref></type>
          <declname>_Callback</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Sets the callback function of a vertex. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">_Vertex</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Target vertex to update the callback of.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">_Callback</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The new callback that _Vertex must use. May be NULL.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>If _Vertex is NULL, returns <ref refid="group__ndxl__err_1gae9261a8e1c9a6cebdc947ee5798cca1e" kindref="member">NDXL_ERR</ref>, otherwise updates the callback of _Vertex, and returns NDXL_OK.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="warning"><para>This function should never be used from within an existing callback function, as replacing a callback while it is executing can corrupt the calling stack. Additionally, this function should not be called from within a dynamics or noise function, as these may be invoked multiple times during a simulation step.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Errors raised</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__ndxl__err_1gaf6b8bdcb87bdd7944810152b510101e4" kindref="member">NDXL_ARG_ERR</ref> : _Vertex is NULL.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
